ded by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  17 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 17 01 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast mass   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm piece of fibrofatty breast tissue with a suture indicating a firm area  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a firm fibrofatty tissue  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes A through J  J  contains sutured area   Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  NO AREA SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  DAVID SABLE  MD O R  Diagnosis by  G  Richard Dickersin  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Present.
